des/code/combo/seed8274950/1/codegen_prompts/6.md:268:Slide yellow pixels inside walled regions in the direction dictated by border-legend arrows.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1804443487/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:12:- `description`：将网格中的多色连通对象按照\"投影重叠\"规则确定切割方向，切割后两半分别染上由邻近标记点指定的颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1804443487/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:21:  - 第一步（确定切割轴）：对每个对象，将其所有像素分别向上、下、左、右四个方向投射到网格边界，形成四条\"影子带\"（即将对象沿该方向压扁到一条线上的投影）。检查哪个方向的影子带与其他对象的影子带存在重叠（占据相同的行或列）。选择重叠像素数最多的方向作为\"切割方向\"：若重叠最多的是向左或向右的投影，则沿垂直轴切割（即用一条垂直线将对象左右分开）；若重叠最多的是向上或向下的投影，则沿水平轴切割（即用一条水平线将对象上下分开）。切割线过对象的几何中心行或中心列（像素范围的中间行/列）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1804443487/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:26:- `Key insight`：解题者首先需要发现切割方向不是任意的，而是由对象之间的投影重叠关系决定的（第一层推理——需要观察多个对象的空间分布来归纳\"为什么这个对象横切而那个对象竖切\"），然后需要理解两个标记点的空间位置如何分别对应切割后的两半（第二层推理——标记点的方位就是染色的分配依据）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1804443487/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:85:Project maroon markers into adjacent grey or pink 3x3 squares, erasing grey squares afterward.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1804443487/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:88:The grid has a dominant background, solid 3x3 grey and/or pink squares, and maroon marker pixels or segments directly touching one side of exactly one square.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1804443487/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:90:Grey squares are erased; their adjacent maroon markers stay in place and stamp the nearest edge cell inside the grey square. Pink squares stay pink; their adjacent maroon markers disappear and stamp the corresponding cell on the square's middle row or middle column.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1804443487/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:97:  \"src\": \"maroon marker pixels or segments adjacent to solid grey or pink 3x3 square objects\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1804443487/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:98:  \"transform\": \"erase grey squares after stamping maroon into each touched near-edge cell; keep grey-adjacent markers in place; keep pink squares,