/new/ARC_code/eval/e3721c99.py:280:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/142ca369.py:10:    - bg grid with monochrome 3-pixel L-shaped \"arrows\" (2x2 bbox missing one corner) and scattered colored wall pixels.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo/seed1544388365/5/codegen_prompts/3.md:90:- bg = most frequent color. Hollow 0-frames (possibly partial L-shapes); each\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo/seed1544388365/5/codegen_prompts/3.md:308:Slide yellow pixels inside walled regions in the direction dictated by border-legend arrows.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo/seed1544388365/15/codegen_prompts/4.md:257:Slide yellow pixels inside walled regions in the direction dictated by border-legend arrows.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo/seed1544388365/15/codegen_prompts/4.md:354:- Scattered L-shaped corner markers of each marker color define opposite corners of axis-aligned rectangles.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo/seed1544388365/15/codegen_prompts/4.md:359:- Determine which two bbox corners carry L-shaped anchors — the *other* diagonal defines the fill region.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo/seed1544388365/15/codegen_prompts/4.md:364:Key insight: The L-shaped anchors sit on the marker diagonal; the fill goes on the opposite diagonal of the bounding box.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo/seed1544388365/13/des.md:43:  - 每个锚点恰好与一个非背景色的单像素标记相邻（4-连通），该标记的颜色与框内图案的颜色相同（Red）。标记相对于锚点的方向（上/下/左/右）称为\"指示方向\"。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo/seed1544388365/13/des.md:47:  - 对每个锚点，计算\"指示方向\"（标记相对于锚点的方向）。将模板旋转，使基准边的朝向与指示方向一致（例如模板默认基准边朝上，而指示方向朝右，则模板顺时针旋转 90 度）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo/seed1544388365/5/codegen_prompts/2.md:18:  - 每条导轨的一端有一个 red 单像素终止标记，紧邻导轨末端外侧（不在导轨上），指示堆叠方向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo/seed44865127/1/codegen_prompts/3.md:177:Slide yellow pixels inside walled regions in the direction dictated by border-legend arrows.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo/seed1544388365/1/codegen_prompts/4.md:16:  - 网格中有若干个\"信号塔\"：每个信号塔是一个 3×3 的实心方块，方块为某种颜色（如 Red、Blue 等）。在方块的某一侧正中间外侧紧邻一个同色像素，形成一个突出的\"箭头\"，指示发射方向（上、下、左、右四个方向之一）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo/seed1544388365/3/des.md:40:缺口不是破损——它是碎片的\"出口\"，指示了碎片应被推出的方向；解题者需要先识别每个房间边框上缺口的位置来确定推出方向，再理解碎片是作为一个刚性整体被平移推出（而非逐像素移动或旋转），最后计算出恰好使碎片完全移出房间的平移距离。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/f8f52ecc.py:117:    - Connect each consecutive pair by the shortest clear L-shaped path between the two components.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo/seed1731172763/3/des.md:48:- `Input structure`：背景为 Azure。网格中有多种前景颜色的像素（如 Red、Blue、Green、Yellow），它们形成若干单像素厚的直线段（水平或垂直）。这些线段的端点相互连接，围成若干封闭的多边形区域（矩形或 L 形等直角多边形）。\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
